AppNeta Intelligent Alarm ({S 304}) - {S 306} on item {S 308}

SYMPTOMS:

An AppNeta Intelligent Alarms rule has triggered on a monitored network path or web path.
The rule name, severity, item and description are shown as AppNeta reported them.

PROBABLE CAUSES:

The conditions defined in the named AppNeta rule were met, as determined by AppNeta's own
monitoring criteria for that rule. See the event for the rule's description.

RECOMMENDED ACTIONS:

Review this alarm's details in AppNeta's Intelligent Alarms console to determine root cause;
the event carries a direct link. This alarm clears automatically when AppNeta reports the
underlying condition resolved.
